      "widgets_values": [
        "Hand-written IMAGE_IR -> generic grounded prompt\n\nThe advanced / debugging path: no vision model, you record what you see yourself.\n\n  =  observed        subject.gaze = toward camera\n  ~  uncertain       wardrobe.top_material ~ smooth | satin, silk\n  !  absent          subject.jewellery !\n\nTrailing markers: @0.42 confidence, @verify asks for a second look, @viewer / @subject\noverride the geometry frame for that one line.\n\nThe tiers are CORE / DETAIL / FINAL — not H1/H2/H3. \"H3\" means MiniMax H3, which has its\nown composer node; a tier called h3 that was not an H3 prompt was a trap.\n\nwardrobe.top_material comes out as \"smooth blouse\", never \"satin blouse\" — and satin and\nsilk do NOT appear in the negative prompt either. \"We could not tell\" is not \"it is not\"."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
